c6f6cb89 (Lua V. R.        2024-06-23 21:27:13 -0300 30) provided `0 < n`. -/
fab98d30 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 23:20:12 +0200 31) theorem birkhoffAverage_of_invariant {M : Type*} [AddCommMonoid M] [Module R M] [CharZero R]
fab98d30 (Oliver Butterley 2025-06-02 23:20:12 +0200 32)     {f : α → α} {φ : α → M} (h : φ ∘ f = φ) {n : ℕ} (hn : 0 < n) : birkhoffAverage R f φ n = φ := by
